  "finalAuditGates": [
    "[AC93-PROFILE|EV93-PROFILE] The profile reuses existing workflow authority, remains read-only until an approved remediation task starts, and cannot accept a high-severity remediation without the configured verification gate.",
    "[AC93-FINDINGS|EV93-FINDINGS] Imported findings remain untrusted evidence until validated and linked to the current source.",
    "[AC93-EXECUTION|EV93-EXECUTION] Potentially harmful execution cannot begin from an imported finding or profile alone; explicit plan opt-in, sandbox evidence and bounded authorization are required.",
    "[AC93-REVIEW|EV93-REVIEW] At the real task-acceptance boundary, implementer-only evidence is rejected for high-severity remediation and a fresh, lineage-matched independent verification assignment is required.",
    "[AC93-DOCUMENTATION|EV93-DOCUMENTATION] Users can run investigation and remediation without confusing advisory findings with confirmed vulnerabilities.",
    "[AC93-ACTIVATION|EV93-ACTIVATION] The profile remains optional and has no effect on ordinary task routing."
  ]
